2nd way using and operator=====>  
db.watchHistory.find({
   $and: [
     { plan: "Premium" },
     { device: "TV" }
   ]
 })

Note :--Use $and when:
You have multiple conditions on the same field

eg :-
❌ This will NOT work:

db.watchHistory.find({
  watchTime: { $gt: 100, $lt: 160 }
})


✅ Correct using $and:

db.watchHistory.find({
  $and: [
    { watchTime: { $gt: 100 } },
    { watchTime: { $lt: 160 } }
  ]
})

