🚀 AGGREGATION

11) Total Watch Time Per User
-->
db.watchHistory.aggregate(
  {
    $group:{
    _id:"$userName",
    TotalwatchTime:{ $sum:"$watchTime"}
     }
   }
 )

output :- 
{ "_id" : "Sneha", "TotalwatchTime" : 138 }
{ "_id" : "Pankaj", "TotalwatchTime" : 190 }
{ "_id" : "Arjun", "TotalwatchTime" : 317 }

12) 
-->
db.watchHistory.aggregate([
  {
    $group: {
      _id: "$genre",
      totalTime: { $sum: "$watchTime" }
    }
  },
  { $sort: { totalTime: -1 } },
  { $limit: 1 }
])

output :- 
{ "_id" : "Sci-Fi", "TotalWatchTime" : 317 }


